# L §6.1 Kinds across members: "A kind a member declares is that member's (a.spending) ... and two members' kinds are
# one only by a same line. Things stated same are bound once." Both members declare persons; the joint model states
# same a.persons = b.persons and same a.ola = b.ola_k: one kind, whose things are ana, ola (= ola_k) and ben, so n = 3;
# o reads ana's income and ben's pocket at the one thing: 10.00 + 5.00 = 15.00 PLN. same a.wsp = b.wsp: one account (of
# one kind), its two openings agree (1 000.00 PLN); "A binding over places of several members counts each place once":
# t = 1 000.00 PLN. Round 14 (L §6.1): a side names "a kind, a thing ..., a row ... or a movement"; "two kinds declared
# alike ... two kinds stated same are one kind, so a binding over either ranges over the things and movements of both".
=== options pin=bytes
=== joint.tally
model family
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-05
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  use a = "ana.tally" sha256 "e438b0e9e801813f005290db20ae57dbafcfc06810324f3ba998080e5c2db6c3"
  use b = "ben.tally" sha256 "62b0623690f8004e28037173884be55e87162cbbd244eb89cae891e9e3867ce4"
  same a.persons = b.persons
  same a.ola = b.ola_k
  same a.wsp = b.wsp

ask n: count(p in a.persons on 2026-06-01)
ask s: sum(a.income[p] for p in a.persons on 2026-06-01)
ask sp: sum(b.pocket[p] for p in b.persons on 2026-06-01)
ask o: a.income[a.ola] + b.pocket[a.ola]
ask w: bal(a.wsp, 2026-06-01)
ask t: sum(bal(p, 2026-06-01) for p in accounts on 2026-06-01)
=== ana.tally
model ana
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-05
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "umowa"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
kind persons
place wsp: accounts PLN lives 2019-01-01..
input income[p in persons]: money PLN

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-12-01
  persons + [ana, ola] lives 2000-01-01..
  income[ana] = 100.00 PLN "umowa"
  income[ola] = 10.00 PLN "umowa"
  opening[wsp] = 1 000.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "wyciąg"
=== ben.tally
model ben
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-05
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "umowa"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
kind persons
place wsp: accounts PLN lives 2019-01-01..
input pocket[p in persons]: money PLN

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-12-01
  persons + [ben, ola_k] lives 2000-01-01..
  pocket[ben] = 50.00 PLN "umowa"
  pocket[ola_k] = 5.00 PLN "umowa"
  opening[wsp] = 1 000.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "wyciąg"
=== expect n o w t
n: 3
  cut 2026-01-05
o: 15.00 PLN
  cut 2026-01-05
w: 1 000.00 PLN
  cut 2026-01-05
t: 1 000.00 PLN
  cut 2026-01-05
